      "note": "Dask is NOT in Pyodide 314.0.6's package index, but it publishes a pure-Python wheel and so do its two missing dependencies. `click`, `cloudpickle`, `fsspec`, `packaging`, `pyyaml` and `toolz` come from the pinned runtime's own lock and are loaded with `loadPackage`; only `dask`, `partd` and `locket` are mirrored. `tlz`, which `dask.utils` imports, ships inside the `toolz` wheel. Every install is `micropip.install(url, deps=False)` against an explicit URL, so resolution never reaches PyPI."
