      "note": "Cartopy 0.25.0 IS in the pinned runtime's lock, with shapely, pyshp, pyproj, matplotlib and scipy; it is loaded lazily on import like any other. What is missing is only the data, which Cartopy otherwise fetches through `urllib` at figure-render time - and there is no socket in a Worker. These are the two 110m feature sets `ax.coastlines()` and `feature.BORDERS` ask for, staged under Cartopy's own layout and pointed at with CARTOPY_DATA_DIR, which is read at import and needs no Cartopy import to set."
